      { question: "What does the Control Unit do?", options: ["Performs arithmetic", "Decodes instructions and generates control signals (the conductor)", "Stores data", "Connects to I/O"], answer: 1, explanations: ["That's the ALU.", "Correct — the CU decodes instructions and generates control signals that orchestrate every operation. It's the conductor.", "That's registers.", "That's the bus."], difficulty: "medium" }
